column36:
I use the following changes to the style sheet for some more colour contrast:<p><pre><code>    /* Increase contrast on some arrows */
    .T-I-ax7.T-I-JE .T-I-J3 {
        opacity: 0.1 !important;
    }

    /* Make new chat highlight red instead of blue */
    .Hz .k, .Hz .n, .Hz .l {
        background: none repeat scroll 0% 0% rgb(192, 0, 0) !important;
    }</code></pre>
